# Grok

Call Grok only through `extract()` in `src/grok/client.ts`. Use it only to turn free text into one fixed schema.

Validate that output with a schema. Code makes every decision after that, including any version comparison. The file that calls `extract()` says what that call decides.

Follow `.cursor/skills/writing-extractors/SKILL.md`.
